  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribution to Somalia&apos;s IFI arrears clearance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As part of a coordinated international effort to normalise Somalia&apos;s relations with the International Financial Institutions, the UK is making a grant contribution and providing a bridging loan to support the clearance of Somalia&apos;s arrears. This will enable to IFIs to support Somalia&apos;s development with their normal suite of operations.</narrative>
  </description>
